  - lineId: chapter_yowashi_diary_002
    speakerId: 
    expressionId: 
    text: "『20XX年4月8日』"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    nextScenePath: 
    nextLineId: chapter_yowashi_diary_003
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: chapter_yowashi_diary_003
    speakerId: 
    expressionId: 
    text: "今年も入学式に行けなかった。いくら私が体調は大丈夫だって言っても、ママは聞いてくれない。なんで私の言うことを信じてくれないんだろう。"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    nextScenePath: 
    nextLineId: chapter_yowashi_diary_004
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: chapter_yowashi_diary_004
    speakerId: 
    expressionId: 
    text: "『20XX年5月12日』"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    nextScenePath: 
    nextLineId: chapter_yowashi_diary_005
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: chapter_yowashi_diary_005
    speakerId: 
    expressionId: 
    text: "今年初めて学校に行けた。何回もママにおねだりした甲斐があったかも。とても嬉しかったのに、学校に行ってみたら咳が止まらなくなった。なんで？友達はすごく心配してくれたのに、私は、私は、私は"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    nextScenePath: 
    nextLineId: chapter_yowashi_diary_006
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: chapter_yowashi_diary_006
    speakerId: 
    expressionId: 
    text: "『20XX年5月13日』"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    nextScenePath: 
    nextLineId: chapter_yowashi_diary_007
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: chapter_yowashi_diary_007
    speakerId: 
    expressionId: 
    text: "私は今日から弱音を吐かないことにした。そのためには明るくいよう。だって漫画のキャラクターで弱音吐いてる子なんて誰もいない。あのキャラみたいになりたい。"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    nextScenePath: 
    nextLineId: chapter_yowashi_diary_008
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: chapter_yowashi_diary_008
    speakerId: 
    expressionId: 
    text: "『20XX年6月6日』"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    nextScenePath: 
    nextLineId: chapter_yowashi_diary_009
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: chapter_yowashi_diary_009
    speakerId: 
    expressionId: 
    text: "大丈夫、私は明るい子、強い子、大丈夫。"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    nextScenePath: 
    nextLineId: chapter_yowashi_diary_010
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: chapter_yowashi_diary_010
    speakerId: 
    expressionId: 
    text: "『20XX年6月7日』"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    nextScenePath: 
